<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4332"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 19, 2005 - 12:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I found out that the company that Nancy Fox worked at at the time of her death called The Law Company Inc. is located just next to the Libary and very near the phone box that BTK jused to call police and tell about NF큦 murder. <BR> <BR>And here is a map of ALL BTK큦 crimesceen locations <BR> <BR>Here is a map of where The Law Company Inc. was located at the time of N.Fox큦 death: <BR> <BR>OFFICE: 313 S. Market St, Wichita  <BR>&#40;there are also two other adresses for The Law Company Inc. in 1977 : Yards: 218 W. Dewey and <BR>1801 McLean Blvd S.&#41; <BR> <BR><a href="http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name=&amp;ed=uV6QQup_0Tp_BS03_xo5jooBkO0UgA_1rpZ5QCfIUC8.DObPQ7gAzN.6AQ..HRf2QcL1zbFtAcWir80ACaBs85uuy6Nl3MoxMrtZ8FKSAnAwiQ--&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C%2BKS%2B67202-3805&amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=678&amp;cat=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;pan_x=0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1" target=_top>http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name= &amp;ed=uV6QQup_0Tp_BS03_xo5jooBkO0UgA_1rpZ5QCfIUC8.DO bPQ7gAzN.6AQ..HRf2QcL1zbFtAcWir80ACaBs85uuy6Nl3Mox MrtZ8FKSAnAwiQ--&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C&#43;KS&#43;67202- 3805&amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=67 8&amp;cat=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;p an_x=0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1</a> <BR> <BR>And here is Wichita-City Of, Library Wichita Public, Central Library, &#40;316&#41; 261-8500, 223 S Main St, Wichita, KS 67202 . And as far as I understand this is where BTK left a letter in a book october 1975 taking responisbility for the Otero murders. <BR>This librairy is also the library where BTK left a package in 2004, as I underatns it. <BR> <BR><a href="http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name=&amp;ed=oSPCD.p_0ToWgYOrJcK0ZuDMg0bdOVhvqzs6LXCVaZBnVe_IxSI6jkV95XKIyrPCBMQMQDBohlAjdYApQpbrYRKCd_4fB5qR3ZdqUvk1A8k-&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C%2BKS%2B67202-3715&amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=678&amp;cat=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;pan_x=0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1" target=_top>http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name= &amp;ed=oSPCD.p_0ToWgYOrJcK0ZuDMg0bdOVhvqzs6LXCVaZBnVe _IxSI6jkV95XKIyrPCBMQMQDBohlAjdYApQpbrYRKCd_4fB5qR 3ZdqUvk1A8k-&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C&#43;KS&#43;67202-3715 &amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=678&amp;ca t=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;pan_x =0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1</a> <BR> <BR>And here is the approximate location of the phone box that BTK used to call in about the Nancy Fox murder: <BR> a pay phone outside Organ&#39;s Market, 527 E. Central, on the southwest corner of Central and St. Francis.  <BR> <BR>The Law Company Inc. is located about 4-5 blocks from the Pay Phone BTK used.<a href="http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name=&amp;ed=UrPkVOp_0Tocvrt5Nwyuk3GszCOEx20dXgPiw5vudm6TIn4EGdEOigQh7F5rjaYd014EmT_kwp0RRigf.9KQL8O8Z4EQTG2bG46NbrpdiAiwSfSD&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C%2BKS%2B67202-1059&amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=678&amp;cat=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;pan_x=0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1" target=_top>http://maps.yahoo.com/maps_result?zoomin=yes&amp;name= &amp;ed=UrPkVOp_0Tocvrt5Nwyuk3GszCOEx20dXgPiw5vudm6TIn 4EGdEOigQh7F5rjaYd014EmT_kwp0RRigf.9KQL8O8Z4EQTG2b G46NbrpdiAiwSfSD&amp;state=KS&amp;csz=Wichita%2C&#43;KS&#43;67202- 1059&amp;ds=n&amp;uzip=67202&amp;mag=2&amp;desc=&amp;country=US&amp;dma=67 8&amp;cat=&amp;resize=l&amp;trf=0&amp;rezoom=0&amp;.intl=us&amp;compass=&amp;p an_x=0&amp;pan_y=0&amp;panable=1</a> <BR> <BR>Here is som info on The Law Company Inc. <BR> <BR> <BR>THE LAW COMPANY, INC. <BR>P.O. Box 1139  <BR>Wichita, Kansas 67201-1139  <BR>&#40;345 Riverview, 67203&#41;  <BR>Phone: &#40;316&#41; 268-0200  <BR>FAX: &#40;316&#41; 268-0210  <BR>Webpage: <a href="http://www.law-co.com" target=_top>www.law-co.com</a> <BR>E-mail: <a href="mailto:kerschen@law-co.com">kerschen@law-co.com</a>  <BR>Richard M. Kerschen, President &amp;  <BR>Chairman of Board  <BR>G. C. Bolton, Sr. Vice President  <BR>Wendell D. Jack, Vice President  <BR>Kelly E. Stillings, Vice President  <BR>Marc Porter, Vice President  <BR>Members since 1961  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
